WEBVTT

00:00:00.880 --> 00:00:03.320
Previously on Yu-Gi-Oh! VRAINS:

00:00:03.320 --> 00:00:07.120
Ai is taking this very seriously.

00:00:07.120 --> 00:00:10.120
I will protect my brother.

00:00:10.120 --> 00:00:12.360
I won’t let him get the code key!

00:00:12.360 --> 00:00:19.000
Let's see who's stronger: One who has 
something to protect or one who has nothing to lose.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Bring it on, Blue Maiden!

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:25.490
Protect the one who's dear to you!

00:00:25.490 --> 00:00:28.470
Try to defeat me!

00:00:28.470 --> 00:00:30.480
5000 ATK!

00:00:30.480 --> 00:00:34.480
Instead of effect damage, this is 
what Blue Maiden was going for.

00:00:34.480 --> 00:00:38.700
Now even if Water Leviathan halves its ATK...

00:00:38.700 --> 00:00:42.590
...if this attack gets through, 
she'll defeat the Dark Ignis!

00:00:42.590 --> 00:00:46.020
Attack Water Leviathan @Ignister!

00:00:46.020 --> 00:00:47.480
Go!

00:00:47.480 --> 00:00:50.630
You're gonna lose, Bro!

00:00:50.630 --> 00:00:54.230
You can't protect him!

00:00:54.230 --> 00:00:57.200
I activate the trap, HA.I.!

00:00:58.670 --> 00:01:01.470
Strike back, Water Leviathan!

00:01:05.140 --> 00:01:07.780
You failed to protect him.

00:01:07.780 --> 00:01:10.530
Brother…

00:01:10.530 --> 00:01:11.520
Aoi…

00:01:11.520 --> 00:01:16.390
We'll never be apart again, Aoi.

00:01:16.390 --> 00:01:23.540
Same here.  I'll be by your side forever-

00:01:24.480 --> 00:01:25.600
Brother!

00:01:28.050 --> 00:01:30.100
I won’t erase you.

00:01:30.100 --> 00:01:38.280
You - like me - will continue living with 
regret for failing to protect someone dear to you.

00:01:42.690 --> 00:01:46.280
As promised, I'm taking the code key.

00:01:47.440 --> 00:01:50.620
Let's meet again, Playmaker.

00:01:52.880 --> 00:01:54.620
I'm sorry.

00:01:56.480 --> 00:01:58.360
Brother...

00:02:01.450 --> 00:02:10.720
calling & feeling  I take your 
thoughts to heart  VRAINS

00:02:29.310 --> 00:02:38.680
The data storm grazes my cheek, 
so I can't open my eyes

00:02:39.320 --> 00:02:48.630
What are we trying to find?  
Where are we trying to go?

00:02:49.190 --> 00:02:53.870
I won't make anyone sad anymore

00:02:54.200 --> 00:03:02.410
I'll retrieve you  Let's go and look ahead

00:03:02.670 --> 00:03:07.550
By meeting you, the world is in color

00:03:07.940 --> 00:03:13.220
I'll protect you with an unseen bond

00:03:13.520 --> 00:03:17.530
calling  With invisible wings

00:03:17.820 --> 00:03:28.140
Destroy the dark and weakness within me

00:03:56.010 --> 00:03:57.720
Fujiki.

00:04:06.320 --> 00:04:09.500
I couldn’t protect my brother.

00:04:09.500 --> 00:04:11.050
It’s not your fault.

00:04:11.050 --> 00:04:13.960
We were there too.  But…

00:04:13.960 --> 00:04:16.730
No.  It’s my fault.

00:04:16.730 --> 00:04:19.440
You shouldn’t blame yourself.

00:04:19.440 --> 00:04:22.270
Stay with Zaizen.

00:04:23.560 --> 00:04:24.980
Let’s go.

00:04:24.980 --> 00:04:26.710
You’re going after Ai?

00:04:27.260 --> 00:04:28.450
Yeah.

00:04:28.450 --> 00:04:31.950
How?  Do you have a lead?

00:04:31.950 --> 00:04:33.240
No.

00:04:33.240 --> 00:04:37.310
Ai acquired SOL Technologies’s code keys.

00:04:37.310 --> 00:04:40.670
SOL Technologies is under his control.

00:04:40.670 --> 00:04:44.900
No one knows what he’ll do anymore.

00:05:21.170 --> 00:05:23.060
Identity confirmed.

00:05:23.060 --> 00:05:26.510
Your visit is limited to one hour.

00:05:26.510 --> 00:05:30.180
You may not take anything out, 
except personal property.

00:05:30.180 --> 00:05:35.440
Accessing company systems and 
operating equipment are forbidden.

00:05:35.440 --> 00:05:37.210
You may enter.

00:05:38.920 --> 00:05:41.750
It's like a checkpoint.

00:05:51.700 --> 00:05:54.700
No one’s here.  What’s going on?

00:05:54.700 --> 00:05:56.730
Hayami?

00:05:57.400 --> 00:05:59.600
Didn't you look at your email?

00:05:59.600 --> 00:06:01.680
I did, but…

00:06:01.680 --> 00:06:03.790
No one’s here anymore.

00:06:03.790 --> 00:06:07.230
You should gather your belongings quickly.

00:06:07.230 --> 00:06:10.350
Those SOLtiS are creepy.

00:06:10.350 --> 00:06:13.280
They’re doing surveillance.

00:06:13.280 --> 00:06:15.710
You’re quitting too?

00:06:15.710 --> 00:06:19.960
They gave me a huge severance, so it's fine.

00:06:19.960 --> 00:06:22.290
Bye, Hayami.

00:06:25.680 --> 00:06:29.730
After Executive Director 
Zaizen fought so hard…

00:06:41.230 --> 00:06:44.320
LINK VRAINS is the best!

00:06:44.320 --> 00:06:47.320
LINK VRAINS has reopened.

00:06:47.320 --> 00:06:49.470
This is Ai’s doing.

00:06:49.470 --> 00:06:56.390
He released all content for free, so 
more players than before have logged in.

00:06:56.390 --> 00:06:59.400
What is he planning to do?

00:07:00.890 --> 00:07:02.600
It’s an email from Revolver.

00:07:03.920 --> 00:07:06.300
He wants to see you.

00:07:06.300 --> 00:07:08.890
Did he find a lead to Ai?

00:07:08.890 --> 00:07:11.610
Maybe.  Let’s go!

00:07:14.800 --> 00:07:16.820
Ai is up to something.

00:07:16.820 --> 00:07:18.170
Yeah.

00:07:18.960 --> 00:07:21.240
What's Ai planning to do?

00:07:21.240 --> 00:07:24.560
He closed SOL Technologies.

00:07:24.560 --> 00:07:25.920
Closed?

00:07:25.920 --> 00:07:28.840
But LINK VRAINS is open.

00:07:28.840 --> 00:07:31.400
He didn’t shut down the system.

00:07:31.400 --> 00:07:32.960
He shut the corporation.

00:07:32.960 --> 00:07:36.530
All employees and executives were dismissed.

00:07:36.530 --> 00:07:41.270
Currently, SOL Technologies’s 
HQ is occupied by SOLtiS.

00:07:41.270 --> 00:07:44.280
Seriously?

00:07:44.280 --> 00:07:47.820
So Ai is controlling LINK VRAINS?

00:07:48.480 --> 00:07:54.460
But what for?  Is he going 
to use humans, like Bohman?

00:07:54.460 --> 00:07:57.260
I don’t want to believe 
that Ai would do that.

00:07:57.260 --> 00:08:04.000
Many have been terminated, including 
SOL Technologies's previous management.

00:08:04.000 --> 00:08:06.670
Stop thinking optimistically.

00:08:06.670 --> 00:08:08.470
I know.

00:08:08.470 --> 00:08:11.050
Can we find Ai?

00:08:11.050 --> 00:08:12.970
That’s not possible.

00:08:12.970 --> 00:08:20.480
The Dark Ignis controls SOL Technologies’s 
system using a new Ignis algorithm.

00:08:20.480 --> 00:08:23.480
No one can infiltrate the system.

00:08:23.480 --> 00:08:25.930
In other words, it can’t be found.

00:08:25.930 --> 00:08:28.690
Then we have to go to LINK VRAINS.

00:08:28.690 --> 00:08:31.690
Ai is in LINK VRAINS?

00:08:31.690 --> 00:08:34.240
We may find a lead.

00:08:34.240 --> 00:08:37.930
You think the Dark Ignis is calling for us?

00:08:37.930 --> 00:08:39.660
It's a possibility.

00:08:39.660 --> 00:08:42.400
If we find the Dark Ignis…

00:08:42.400 --> 00:08:45.000
We’ll end things then!

00:08:45.000 --> 00:08:47.240
It might be a trap, but...

00:08:47.240 --> 00:08:50.890
It's decided!  Let’s go!

00:08:50.890 --> 00:08:51.840
Yeah.

00:09:03.480 --> 00:09:08.200
Revolver, what's my next role?

00:09:08.200 --> 00:09:10.500
Your role is over.

00:09:10.500 --> 00:09:13.200
The Dark Ignis saved you.

00:09:13.200 --> 00:09:15.850
Was I saved?

00:09:15.850 --> 00:09:19.200
Or did I just happen to be saved?

00:09:19.200 --> 00:09:21.130
Maybe so.

00:09:21.130 --> 00:09:25.720
The Dark Ignis may have wanted you to live.

00:09:25.720 --> 00:09:27.680
That’s a possibility.

00:09:27.680 --> 00:09:29.780
But why?

00:09:29.780 --> 00:09:32.150
That's for you to figure out.

00:09:32.150 --> 00:09:35.390
That's a very difficult question.

00:09:35.390 --> 00:09:41.820
Thinking on your own gives 
meaning to those with free will.

00:09:41.820 --> 00:09:44.260
Try to enjoy it.

00:09:54.970 --> 00:09:56.600
Let’s split up and search!

00:09:56.600 --> 00:09:57.980
Okay!

00:10:05.380 --> 00:10:08.090
But I'm not giving up!

00:10:08.090 --> 00:10:12.690
But I still have the card 
of destiny I just drew.

00:10:12.690 --> 00:10:19.300
Appliancers have different effects, 
depending on whether they're co-linked or not!

00:10:19.300 --> 00:10:20.640
Here I go!

00:10:20.640 --> 00:10:24.010
Vacculephant attacks you directly!

00:10:27.610 --> 00:10:32.310
Next, Laundry Dragon attacks Memorygant!

00:10:32.310 --> 00:10:36.410
But too bad.  It's already over!

00:10:36.410 --> 00:10:39.250
Oh no!  You can't withstand that damage!

00:10:39.250 --> 00:10:41.390
Laundry Dragon!

00:10:47.320 --> 00:10:49.370
Move, Emma!

00:10:52.660 --> 00:10:58.030
I’m really strong!

00:10:58.030 --> 00:11:02.430
And I’m going to become stronger!

00:11:02.430 --> 00:11:06.270
I feel like I’m melting.

00:11:06.270 --> 00:11:08.760
It feels great!

00:11:15.450 --> 00:11:19.120
Bro!  Was I sleeping?

00:11:19.120 --> 00:11:22.060
Yeah, you were.

00:11:22.060 --> 00:11:24.560
I was dreaming.

00:11:24.560 --> 00:11:27.470
Dreaming?  That’s impressive.

00:11:27.470 --> 00:11:31.610
Dreaming is proof that you have free will.

00:11:31.610 --> 00:11:33.420
Really?

00:11:33.420 --> 00:11:36.080
What did you dream about?

00:11:36.080 --> 00:11:42.350
Umm…  I was floating in space.

00:11:44.080 --> 00:11:48.250
And my entire body was shining.

00:11:49.520 --> 00:11:54.830
And I felt great and melted into space!

00:11:56.840 --> 00:11:57.950
Roboppi!

00:11:57.950 --> 00:11:58.990
Yes?

00:11:58.990 --> 00:12:02.840
That may be an incredible dream!

00:12:02.840 --> 00:12:05.300
An incredible dream?

00:12:07.360 --> 00:12:11.980
It’s a dream that you’ve 
become one with the universe!

00:12:11.980 --> 00:12:17.980
That’s right!  Only the chosen 
AI can see that legendary dream!

00:12:17.980 --> 00:12:20.410
The dream of a conqueror!

00:12:24.350 --> 00:12:26.250
A dream of a conqueror?

00:12:26.250 --> 00:12:30.500
Bro, am I going to get stronger and stronger?

00:12:30.500 --> 00:12:33.720
Of course!  You will become strong.

00:12:33.720 --> 00:12:40.240
You’ll become so strong that 
you'll conquer the universe!

00:12:41.950 --> 00:12:43.240
That strong?

00:12:43.240 --> 00:12:47.010
Will I be stronger than you, Bro?

00:12:47.010 --> 00:12:50.010
Yes, you will...

00:12:50.010 --> 00:12:50.980
...probably.

00:12:50.980 --> 00:12:52.860
Probably!

00:12:52.860 --> 00:12:58.360
Bro, you’re like a fortune 
teller or a sage or a saint!

00:12:58.360 --> 00:13:00.460
Because I’m dressed like one.

00:13:00.460 --> 00:13:03.690
I thought you were just a dirty old man.

00:13:03.690 --> 00:13:06.160
W-What?

00:13:06.160 --> 00:13:07.800
Nothing.

00:13:07.800 --> 00:13:08.810
I see.

00:13:08.810 --> 00:13:10.200
Yes.

00:13:10.200 --> 00:13:15.670
When you become a big deal, take care of me.

00:13:15.670 --> 00:13:18.910
Of course!  I'll take care of you forever!

00:13:18.910 --> 00:13:21.910
Now I don’t have to worry when I’m old.

00:13:21.910 --> 00:13:24.420
AIs have old age?

00:13:26.300 --> 00:13:30.420
I have a reward for you.

00:13:30.420 --> 00:13:32.110
Reward?

00:13:32.110 --> 00:13:36.920
Since you worked hard in our recent 
mission, I’ll give you a country.

00:13:36.920 --> 00:13:38.700
My own country?

00:13:38.700 --> 00:13:40.280
Look at this!

00:13:41.240 --> 00:13:45.230
I made you a country inside LINK VRAINS.

00:13:46.500 --> 00:13:48.940
That’s my country?

00:13:48.940 --> 00:13:55.610
Use it as your foothold to conquer 
the world and the universe.

00:13:57.140 --> 00:14:02.120
Hooray!  I’m the owner of my own domain!

00:14:02.120 --> 00:14:03.470
Roboppi…

00:14:04.120 --> 00:14:07.360
I'll also give you this.

00:14:09.310 --> 00:14:11.600
What is it?

00:14:11.600 --> 00:14:13.710
Don’t worry about it.

00:14:13.710 --> 00:14:17.600
Now go, Roboppi!  To your own country!

00:14:17.600 --> 00:14:20.840
Okay!  I'm going right now!

00:14:20.840 --> 00:14:28.240
But if it's in LINK VRAINS, 
I might run into Playmaker.

00:14:28.240 --> 00:14:29.610
If that happens…

00:14:29.610 --> 00:14:33.390
If that happens, protect your country!

00:14:33.390 --> 00:14:36.840
They stand in your way from 
conquering the universe!

00:14:36.840 --> 00:14:40.480
You’re right!  Okay, I’m going!

00:14:59.530 --> 00:15:02.380
Bye, Roboppi.

00:15:03.960 --> 00:15:06.600
It should be around here.

00:15:08.950 --> 00:15:10.280
There!

00:15:17.060 --> 00:15:20.060
Hooray!  My own country!

00:15:20.060 --> 00:15:22.800
Everyone, come out!

00:15:22.800 --> 00:15:26.040
I’m Roboppi!  An appliance!

00:15:26.040 --> 00:15:28.270
I’m the same as you!

00:15:30.240 --> 00:15:33.820
Are you citizens of my country?

00:15:33.820 --> 00:15:36.210
Yes!  We are!

00:15:36.210 --> 00:15:39.950
I’ll soon make you smart like me!

00:15:40.780 --> 00:15:42.950
Hooray!

00:15:43.690 --> 00:15:46.890
But before that, let’s play!

00:16:05.940 --> 00:16:08.200
Was that island there before?

00:16:20.040 --> 00:16:24.330
Everyone?  What’s wrong?

00:16:26.730 --> 00:16:28.700
Soulburner!

00:16:28.700 --> 00:16:32.670
Roboppi, what are you doing here?

00:16:32.670 --> 00:16:35.130
This is my country.

00:16:35.130 --> 00:16:37.910
Soulburner, why are you here?

00:16:37.910 --> 00:16:40.910
This is your country?

00:16:40.910 --> 00:16:43.910
That’s right!  My country!

00:16:43.910 --> 00:16:45.900
A country of appliances!

00:16:45.900 --> 00:16:48.890
Soulburner, you’re not an appliance.

00:16:48.890 --> 00:16:51.580
So leave immediately!

00:16:51.580 --> 00:16:55.930
I can’t do that.  We’re searching for Ai.

00:16:55.930 --> 00:16:59.470
Tell me where Ai is!

00:16:59.470 --> 00:17:03.100
Even if I knew, I wouldn't tell you.

00:17:03.100 --> 00:17:06.830
What are you two planning to do?

00:17:06.830 --> 00:17:10.060
I don’t know what Bro is planning to do.

00:17:10.060 --> 00:17:14.580
But I’m going to start conquering 
the universe from here!

00:17:14.580 --> 00:17:17.820
Conquer the universe?  You?

00:17:17.820 --> 00:17:20.820
Are you underestimating my skills?

00:17:20.820 --> 00:17:24.590
Even Bro acknowledges my skills!

00:17:24.590 --> 00:17:29.560
I'll become greater than my Bro and become 
the AI that conquers the universe!

00:17:30.200 --> 00:17:35.230
Got that?  If you do, leave 
this country immediately!

00:17:35.230 --> 00:17:38.300
Humans aren't needed in this country!

00:17:38.300 --> 00:17:40.570
Sorry, but I can’t do that.

00:17:40.570 --> 00:17:43.510
Not until you tell me where Ai is.

00:17:43.510 --> 00:17:47.210
So you won't leave?  In that case…

00:17:49.180 --> 00:17:50.880
A duel?

00:17:50.880 --> 00:17:55.590
If you defeat me, I’ll 
tell you where Bro is.

00:17:56.240 --> 00:17:59.660
Fine.  I’ll be your opponent.

00:18:01.630 --> 00:18:03.590
Let’s begin!

00:18:03.590 --> 00:18:04.810
Duel!

00:18:08.060 --> 00:18:11.270
Yusaku!  Takeru found Roboppi.

00:18:11.720 --> 00:18:13.470
I’ll send you the coordinates.

00:18:21.610 --> 00:18:23.610
They've started.

00:18:23.610 --> 00:18:25.820
So Soulburner is the opponent.

00:18:25.820 --> 00:18:32.570
Roboppi is an appliance AI, but he 
defeated Blood Shepherd and Ghost Girl.

00:18:32.570 --> 00:18:34.230
I can’t let my guard down.

00:18:34.230 --> 00:18:37.230
I will protect my country!

00:18:37.930 --> 00:18:39.560
My turn!

00:18:39.560 --> 00:18:44.570
I activate the Field Spell, 
Appliancer Electrilyrical World!

00:18:58.180 --> 00:19:04.990
When it activates, I add an Appliancer 
spell card from my deck to my hand.

00:19:06.460 --> 00:19:10.620
I summon Appliancer Socketroll!

00:19:13.060 --> 00:19:18.470
I activate Appliancer Copybokkle’s 
effect from my hand!

00:19:18.470 --> 00:19:23.440
When there’s a different 
Appliancer monster on the field...

00:19:23.440 --> 00:19:27.480
...I can select it and 
Special Summon Copybokkle!

00:19:27.480 --> 00:19:32.320
I select Socketroll and 
Special Summon Copybokkle!

00:19:36.000 --> 00:19:39.020
When this effect Special 
Summons Copybokkle...

00:19:39.020 --> 00:19:45.330
...it's treated as the selected monster - 
aka Socketroll - until the end of the turn!

00:19:48.230 --> 00:19:51.240
Now Socketroll’s effect!

00:19:51.240 --> 00:19:54.220
When a monster with the same 
name is Special Summoned...

00:19:54.220 --> 00:19:58.140
...I can Special Summon 
Socketroll from my deck!

00:19:59.380 --> 00:20:03.410
Appear!  The circuit that guides me!

00:20:08.620 --> 00:20:10.240
Link Summon!

00:20:10.240 --> 00:20:15.230
Appear, Link 2 Appliancer Celtopus!

00:20:15.230 --> 00:20:17.190
I Link Summon again!

00:20:19.360 --> 00:20:24.840
Appear, Link 1 Appliancer Propelion!

00:20:28.310 --> 00:20:33.640
The Field Spell, Appliancer Electrilyrical 
World’s effect activates!

00:20:44.320 --> 00:20:49.730
Once per turn, when an Appliancer 
Link Monster is Link Summoned...

00:20:49.730 --> 00:20:54.030
...I return an Appliancer monster 
in the graveyard to the hand.

00:20:54.030 --> 00:20:58.500
I activate the spell card, Appliancer Reuse!

00:21:00.470 --> 00:21:05.940
I Special Summon a Level 4 or lower 
Appliancer from my graveyard!

00:21:05.940 --> 00:21:09.400
Resurrect, Socketroll!

00:21:11.150 --> 00:21:13.380
I’ll Link Summon again!

00:21:15.620 --> 00:21:17.590
Appear!

00:21:18.190 --> 00:21:22.360
Link 1 Appliancer Vacculephant!

00:21:27.900 --> 00:21:30.730
When the monster Special Summoned by

00:21:30.730 --> 00:21:34.240
Appliancer Reuse leaves the field, it returns to my deck.

00:21:38.780 --> 00:21:42.950
I set two cards and end my turn.

00:21:44.920 --> 00:21:49.390
This is the deck that defeated 
Blood Shepherd and Ghost Girl.

00:21:50.840 --> 00:21:53.530
I’m in perfect form again!

00:21:53.530 --> 00:21:56.030
I'll soon conquer the universe!

00:22:05.290 --> 00:22:09.260
I was told repeatedly

00:22:09.260 --> 00:22:16.710
Only tales of dreams

00:22:17.060 --> 00:22:23.680
Is my life precious?

00:22:23.940 --> 00:22:26.670
Make up for  Make up for

00:22:27.040 --> 00:22:34.180
The next sentimental

00:22:39.020 --> 00:22:45.440
I'm not a machine

00:22:48.160 --> 00:22:51.880
I cry a single tear

00:22:53.370 --> 00:22:57.100
A single answer moves me

00:22:58.270 --> 00:23:07.460
We helplessly sing for someone we can't reach

00:23:08.080 --> 00:23:12.890
Are you ready?

00:23:13.390 --> 00:23:18.240
Oh oh oh

00:23:18.760 --> 00:23:23.460
Are you ready?

00:23:24.060 --> 00:23:30.550
Are you ready?

